 数量直接收紧:以前带三四个没人问,现在每人最多2个,多一个都不行。 全程不能用:上了飞机就得收好,不能给设备充电,也不能用USB接...", "engine": "360search", "template": "default.html", "parsed_url": ["https", "post.smzdm.com", "/talk/p/a95n9pme/", "", "", ""], "img_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["360search"], "positions": [4], "score": 0.25, "category": "general", "publishedDate": null, "iframe_src": null}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "pai.com.cn/p/01jyzkn7adbn1a4ehgsnkpemqe", "content": "一、民航局最新规定：禁止携带没有3C认证的充电宝上飞机.今日，民航局也对充电宝出手了：民航局发布紧急通知，自6月28日起禁止旅客携带没有3C标识、3C标识不清晰、被召回型号或批次的充电宝乘坐境内.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [4], "score": 0.25, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.pai.com.cn/p/01jyzkn7adbn1a4ehgsnkpemqe", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.pai.com.cn", "/p/01jyzkn7adbn1a4ehgsnkpemqe", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "今天起，充电宝无3C标识禁登机，3C标识到底长啥样？ _ 东方财富网", "content": "根据国家规定，正规上市的充电宝必须取得3C强制认证。根据《关于民航旅客携带“充电宝”乘机规定的公告》：", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [5], "score": 0.2, "category": "general", "url": "https://finance.eastmoney.com/a/202506283443080455.html", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "finance.eastmoney.com", "/a/202506283443080455.html", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "news.xmnn.cn/xmxw/202506/t20250628_350919.html", "content": "批次、型号的充电宝乘坐境内航班。 26日民航局发布相关通知，自6月28日起对充电宝登机作出限制。 机场安检部门表示，此举是为了应对近期频发的充电宝安全隐患问题，确保航空运输安全。带充电宝乘机需遵守以下规定. 1.充电宝必须是旅客个人自用携带。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length":